{
  "schema": "ld-s10y-image/figure-spec@2",
  "id": "fig-83",
  "mode": "deterministic",
  "description": "Graphical roots of a^x=b for a>1: one increasing positive exponential, positive/zero/negative horizontal cases, and a dashed projection to log_a b. Counted source grid is regularized. Modern schematic a=1.55, positive b=4.5, negative b=-2 and drawing domain [-3.5,5] are not printed givens or scan-precise measurements. Small relationship anchor dots, typographic math labels and the explicit a>1 condition are declared modern additions.",
  "source": {
    "image": {
      "path": "/Users/yong/work/lemmadeck-ws/lemmadeck--STEMROBIN-182/.tmp/ld-s10y-lesson/resume182-7-N36/assembly-FIRST/artifacts/8a/figures/fig-83.png",
      "sha256": "fa7071634c3eb854bfdc662abd65741926ddfcb29533300d3807004feb98432b"
    },
    "authoritativeText": [
      {
        "lesson": "alg8-c6-s1-n36",
        "text": "我们来讨论方程$a^x=b$，其中 $a$ 和 $b$ 是某一个数，并且 $a>0$，$a\\ne1$."
      },
      {
        "lesson": "alg8-c6-s1-n36",
        "text": "当 $b\\leqslant0$ 时，这个方程没有根，因为对于任何 $x$，指数函数$y=a^x$ 的值是正的."
      },
      {
        "lesson": "alg8-c6-s1-n36",
        "text": "当 $b>0$ 时，方程有根，并且是唯一的根. 实际上，当$a\\ne1$ 时，指数函数 $y=a^x$ 的值域是正数集合（于是，方程$a^x=b$ 有根）. 此外，指数函数的每一个值都只是在一个自变量的值下取得的（因此，这个根是唯一的）."
      },
      {
        "lesson": "alg8-c6-s1-n36",
        "text": "图 $83$ 中，画出了在各种$b$ 值下方程 $a^x=b$（$a>1$）的图解."
      }
    ],
    "inventory": [
      {
        "id": "src-panel-grid",
        "description": "One source panel with an 18-column, 27-row ruled lattice. Modern square half-unit cells preserve counts and origin placement (7 columns left, 19 rows above). Scan strokes are regularized, not claimed metrically exact.",
